<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Disney raised to attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Disney raised to attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber raised its recommendation on Walt Disney Co to attractive from neutral, according to a PaineWebber source.</p>
<p>-- In early New York Stock Exchange trade, Disney shares slipped 1/4 to 70.</p>
</text>
